WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.667
And Fred, as

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.935
we understand, this offensive

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.303
may indeed in

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.971
meaningful ways be underway.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.007
What is the latest there

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.341
other, Erin?

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:08.541
Well, there

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.143
certainly is a lot going on in the vast

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.911
battlefields here in Ukraine.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.346
But the bottom line of things

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.280
really is

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.148
that the Russians

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:15.615
don't seem

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.717
to be gaining any ground anywhere.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.419
While the initiative certainly seems

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.087
to be with the Ukrainians,

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.622
you have that situation in Belgorod

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.323
where the Russians

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.591
still have a lot of problems

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.126
coming to terms with things there.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:26.826
Also in

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:27.694
with the Ukrainians

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.561
really think

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.030
that they're making gains there.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.631
And then in the south of the country,

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:32.499
the Russians are saying

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.300
that they're also under pressure

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.135
from the Ukrainians.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.469
Here's what we're learning.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:39.506
Russian military drone video allegedly

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.808
showing a massive Ukrainian attack

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.476
in the south of the country.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:44.544
Some vehicles appear

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:45.645
to be hitting mines

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:48.048
or being the target of indirect fire.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.516
The Russians claiming

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.117
they're able to hold the line

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.118
to the auditory area,

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.686
but the enemy launched

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.055
an unsuccessful attempt

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.523
at a large scale offensive

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.458
in the south of Donetsk access.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:00:59.926
The spokesman for Russia's defense

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.261
ministry said.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.495
But is this already

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.264
Ukraine's much anticipated

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.199
large scale counter offensive

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.904
The Ukrainians claim they have no info.

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:12.405
Kiev put out this video

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.239
urging people

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.474
to not even talk about

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.409
a counter offensive.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.279
Their message plans love silence.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.981
But anti-Putin, Russian

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.616
fighters are loudly

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.918
making their presence felt

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.952
across the border

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.987
in Russia's Belgorod region.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.222
The local governor saying

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.457
hundreds of munitions

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.658
have been fired at towns

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.661
there just in the past day.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:36.162
It's a far cry

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.664
from when we were in this area

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.332
in February of last year

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:42.102
when Russia invaded Ukraine.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.403
Belgorod was one of the main

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.437
staging areas

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.539
for the attack on Ukraine's north east

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.076
teaming with tanks and armored vehicles.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.745
This military hub seemed invincible.

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:53.880
The streets

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.181
that you're seeing up there in the sky,

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.483
I don't know how I can see it right now.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.118
You can see more artillery rockets

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.419
apparently be firing

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:00.720
from Russian territory

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.754
towards the territory.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:02.755
I would say around half.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:03.523
I don't know if you can hear this

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:03.990
right now.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:13.466
Today, Russia's

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.702
army appears bizarrely absent.

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:17.504
This Russian military blogger

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:18.571
dodging for cover

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.906
in the Shabak in a village

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.142
in the Belgorod region.

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:25.378
I just mentioned.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:26.546
We are lying in Shibuya,

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.780
you know, on the ground

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.949
under Ukrainian Grad missiles, he says.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.050
Strikes are coming

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.520
one after another here.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.420
The local governor

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.489
says the shelling from the Ukrainian side

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.657
has been relentless,

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.359
with several killed and wounded

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:41.728
and thousands evacuated.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.029
The leader of the Varner

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.664
private military company

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.432
ripping into the defense ministry.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.701
I wish you would hear your name.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.603
We surrender our historical lands,

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:51.004
he says.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.039
Today, children are getting killed.

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:55.275
Civilians are getting killed in Belgorod.

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:56.843
And the Ministry of Defense

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:59.579
is not in a state to do anything at all.

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.848
As a de facto doesn't exist.

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:02.849
It is chaos,

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:05.985
and the Russians are also

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.587
on the back foot in the area.

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:08.188
Precautions.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.756
Mercenaries just left

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:12.025
Bermuda in east Ukraine.

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:12.992
Moscow's forces

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.861
struggling to fend off a strong

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.262
Ukrainian military,

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:17.430
both in the occupied

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.899
territories and inside Russia.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:21.601
And, you know,

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:22.802
Aaron, Battle, of course,

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:24.804
is a really interesting place

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:26.873
because the Ukrainians seem to have all

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.141
but lost that place.

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.809
And now they say that things

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.311
are going really well for them.

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:32.779
They also say, quite frankly,

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:33.913
they believe why the Russians

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:34.681
want to talk so much

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:35.949
about the south of the country

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:36.749
and the alleged

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:37.951
advances that the Ukrainians

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:38.551
are trying to make

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.320
there is to divert attention

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:40.954
from the fact

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.388
the Russians are losing ground

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:43.356
in Bermuda.

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:44.657
There was one spokeswoman

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:45.892
for the Ukrainian military

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:46.459
who said

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:48.261
that today was a very good day

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.762
for the Ukrainian army. Erin.

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:50.129
All right.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.998
Thank you very much, Fred, in Kiev.

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:52.832
And I want to go straight

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:53.733
now to retired Army

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.068
Lieutenant General Mark Hertling,

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:55.902
the former commanding

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.870
general for Europe in the Seventh Army.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.372
So where do you think we are?

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.073
General, Ukrainian

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:01.107
Deputy Defense Minister

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:01.708
Hannah Miller

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:02.609
today says it's

00:04:02.609 --> 00:04:04.244
not about only about back mount.

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:06.079
The offensive is taking place

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:06.980
in several directions.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.147
So it's present tense.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:09.682
It's multiple locations.

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:10.416
What are you seeing?

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:13.186
Erin, I got to start off by

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:14.320
first complimenting you

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.455
on using the Clausewitz,

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:17.190
the in term fog of war,

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.591
because that's where we are right now.

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:19.892
When we're talking today.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:21.594
We've been talking about mood

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:23.463
for the last several months.

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:25.365
Now we're going to include Volodya

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.267
in over Donetsk, Serbian, Inco,

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.868
Belgorod, Kursk, Smolensk,

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:31.037
and about 100 other places.

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:34.774
What we're talking about is an offensive

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.376
that won't be a massive

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:37.277
beach landing

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:39.012
like we've seen in the movie

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:40.179
Saving Private Ryan,

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:42.282
where tens of thousands of forces

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:44.017
are coming together all at once.

00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:44.550
Instead,

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.586
it will likely be multiple operations

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.421
at different locations

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:50.790
with Ukrainian probing,

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.192
confirming or denying Russian weaknesses,

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:55.862
looking for holes and shifting rush of

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:58.698
Russian forces that are shifting around,

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.900
taking advantage of Russian confusion

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.468
like you just saw on the face

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:04.704
of that young soldier in show Branco.

00:05:04.704 --> 00:05:06.139
And it's all going to occur

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:07.340
at the time and place

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.175
in the Ukrainian decision.

00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:11.511
So what we're talking about right now

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:13.713
is a very different type of offensive.

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:15.348
And we're seeing a building

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:16.949
momentum toward it.

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:19.485
So if you were the commanding general

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.320
for Ukraine,

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.256
what would you want to see Ukraine do

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:23.923
and actually talk about

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:24.924
this building momentum

00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:26.392
and not a Normandy like event,

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:27.960
but what would you

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.496
what would you say should happen now?

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:31.798
Well, first would be an honor

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:32.899
to be the commanding general

00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:33.766
of the Ukraine forces

00:05:33.766 --> 00:05:35.201
because they are doing so well.

00:05:35.201 --> 00:05:37.470
But secondly, what I would like to see

00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:40.540
is the continued small probing actions

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.542
with reconnaissance in force,

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.509
taking advantage

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:45.011
of what Ukrainian forces

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:46.713
find on the front lines.

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:48.214
It's not only going to be an issue

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:51.150
of what conventional forces do, Erin.

00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:53.519
It's going to be a coordination

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.122
between those recon forces,

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:58.124
the operational conventions,

00:05:58.124 --> 00:05:59.492
conventional forces,

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:00.727
the territorial,

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:02.395
the so-called National Guard,

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:03.996
the resistance forces

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:06.032
and even the Russian volunteer corps

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:07.367
that are in different oblast

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:08.801
within Russia itself.

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.770
The commander of Ukrainian forces

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.972
is coordinating all of those things

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:13.706
to cause

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:15.475
the greatest amount of confusion.

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:16.142
And I think

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:16.809
right now

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:18.344
we're seeing indicators of that

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:20.313
because you don't know what's going on.

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:21.781
I don't know what's going on,

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:23.082
and neither do the Russians.

00:06:23.082 --> 00:06:23.983
But I bet your

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:26.018
General Saluzzi knows exactly

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:26.686
what's going on

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:27.920
and he's doing a very good job.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.321
All right.

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:29.455
Thank you very much, General.

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:30.556
I appreciate your time.

